<title>JAPAN: Honda - 96/97 group results (SEC).</title>
<headline>Honda - 96/97 group results (SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.29 trln	 vs	    4.25 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  401.45		vs	  143.63</p>
<p> Pretax	     390.72		vs	  115.13</p>
<p> Net		  221.17		vs	   70.80</p>
<p> EPS		  226.97 yen	  vs	   72.63 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	226.97 yen	  vs	   72.63 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Honda Motor Co Ltd is a leading car and motorcycle manufacturer. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
